        "TileImage": "$($repository 64f38b33-df14-4672-93d8-6e2d996f8111).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, \r\rour intel shows that the Caruso cartel is rapidly expanding their market share in the global weed production. \r\rThe ICA was hired by Dr. Cyrus Cane to eliminate the opposing faction, and negate any further expansion on the global market.\r\rYour job is to go undercover and deal with the leading experts in the cartel. \rHowever, the cartel is aware of a possible attack, and has disguised their members as ordinary workers and surrounded them with guards.\r\rGood luck 47.",
